<title>UK: BOE forecasts 700 mln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 700 mln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 700 million stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise a repo to June 27 and 30, and outright offers of bills maturing on or before June 30.</p>
</text>
